#Instructions to execute gdb4hpc regression tests

ssh to test machine
module load gdb4hpc
load target module for specific processor

If testing gpus:
load cuda toolkit (ensure module for targeted gpu is loaded as well)

There are two modes for the test_script.
mode1 : build
mode2 : run

There are 3 test buckets:
1: basic_list
2. sanity_list
3. full_list
(For now they are all pretty much the same.)

cd tests
./test_script.sh [name of test bucket] [mode]

e.g.
./test_script.sh sanity_list build
./test_script.sh sanity_list run

The test will run and when complete, test analysis will
proceed. This takes a bit of time.

Log files will be dumped to:
/cray/css/ulib/gdb4hpc/regression_testing
